# Semgrep ignore patterns. Matches .gitignore syntax.
#
# Test fixtures intentionally violate security rules to test that vibew's
# own checks catch the violations. They are not production code and must
# not be flagged by Semgrep on PRs that add new fixtures.
#
# Examples:
# - internal/app/dockerfile/testdata/warn_nonroot.Dockerfile is the
#   fixture for the non-root-USER rule (#1140). Adding USER to it would
#   invalidate the test.
# - internal/cli/cmd/testdata/validate/dockerfile_mismatch/Dockerfile
#   tests EXPOSE/port mismatch detection (#1144).
#
# If you need Semgrep to scan a specific testdata file (e.g. a positive
# fixture asserting clean code), use a more specific include rule rather
# than removing this blanket exclude.
**/testdata/**
